Old moria trick.  If you don't like the HP you get for levelling up,
get attacked by a grape jelly (which drains XP) enough to lose a
level, then drink a potion of restore experience (or similar named
potion).  You regain your XP and your HP gain is rerolled.  Moria
didn't track how many HP you gained from levelling up, so this was a
little abuse certain people used to get better HP for their
characters.

David J. Grabiner has some notariety around Moria circles... say
current official maintainer. 
